# rt1 public repository — deliberately minimal.
#
# This is a curated repository, not a working tree. Everything in it was selected against a
# measured list of what the shipping documents cite; nothing arrives here by accident, so there
# is little to exclude. If you find yourself adding broad patterns, prefer not copying the file.

# Release assets are attached to the GitHub release, not committed. The archive is ~209 MB and
# is regenerable from the source tag plus patches/ — see stage/MODIFICATIONS.txt.
dist/

# Build output, if anyone builds in-tree.
build*/
*.obj
*.pdb
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Voice/invariant pass working state. Created by tools/voice-invariant.py during a presentation
# pass; the snapshots are baselines for that pass only and are meaningless once it lands. This
# directory reached the public repo because it was created AFTER the measurement that chose what
# to curate — the third instance of "a file created after a sweep is invisible to that sweep".
.voice/
